    "problems": "The reported performance evaluations use an automated Beaver-7B judge, although the authors provide human-agreement and cross-judge checks. The study's evaluated models are limited to 3B–8B parameters, as noted by the authors.",
    "rows_left_out": "Did not extract helpfulness and harmlessness metric comparisons, TUSA-versus-base or TUSA-versus-ConfPO results, or the random-guidance and no-IDF ablations. These are comparisons of the study's inference-time method and do not measure the weak-label fine-tuning claim; see Tables 1–4.",
